      "decision": "REJECT",
      "reason": "Detecting step-level knowledge gaps and deciding when to retrieve is directly relevant to F2, but the abstract does not show a structured representation of the missing evidence, post-retrieval sufficiency reassessment, calibrated stopping, temporal/version provenance, or budget-aware terminal conditions. Generic adaptive retrieval timing is no longer the principal unresolved capability in this round.",
